graph TD
    classDef governance fill:#1A1A1A,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff,font-family:monospace;
    classDef orchestrator fill:#6366f1,stroke:#4338ca,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;
    classDef agent fill:#0ea5e9,stroke:#0284c7,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;
    classDef fail fill:#f43f5e,stroke:#e11d48,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;
    classDef pass fill:#10b981,stroke:#059669,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff;

    O[Master Orchestrator]:::orchestrator -->|Delegates| G{Orchestrator Governor}:::governance
    
    G -->|Validate Turn Limit| T{Turns > 35?}
    T -- Yes --> H[Governance Halt: Token Burn Prevented]:::fail
    T -- No --> A1[Agent A: Coder]:::agent

    A1 -->|Delegates| G
    G -->|Validate Depth| D{Depth > 3?}
    D -- Yes --> H
    D -- No --> A2[Agent B: Reviewer]:::agent

    A2 -->|Replies to A1| G
    G -->|Validate Agreement| C{Agreement Streak > 3?}
    C -- Yes --> H
    C -- No --> A1

    A1 -->|Handoff Payload| W{Workflow Checkpoint}:::governance
    W -->|Missing JSON Proof| M[Reject: Hallucinated Handoff]:::fail
    W -->|Valid JSON Proof| P[Return State to Orchestrator]:::pass
